## 2. Base & Merge Target Matrix by Job Type (`G1`, `M8`)

| Job Type | Branches From (`Base`) | Branch Name (`G2` — Parent Ticket) | Merges Into (`Target`) | Merge Strategy (`G4`) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Feature / Refactor / Perf / Chore** | `origin/{{integration_branch}}` | `<type>/<PARENT-TICKET>-<short-desc>` | `{{integration_branch}}` | Squash merge |
| **Bug found on DEV** | `origin/{{integration_branch}}` | `fix/<PARENT-TICKET>-<short-desc>` | `{{integration_branch}}` | Squash merge |
| **Bug found on STG (`{{release_pattern}}`)** | `origin/{{release_pattern}}` | `fix/<PARENT-TICKET>-<short-desc>` | `{{release_pattern}}` + `{{integration_branch}}` | Squash merge |
| **Urgent Bug on PROD (`Hotfix`)** | `origin/{{production_branch}}` | `hotfix/<PARENT-TICKET>-<short-desc>` | `{{production_branch}}` (user), then `{{release_pattern}}` & `{{integration_branch}}` | `--no-ff` merge commit (`main`), PR backport (`develop`) |
| **Release Candidate Cut** | `origin/{{integration_branch}}` | `{{release_pattern}}` | `{{production_branch}}` (user) + back-merge to `{{integration_branch}}` | `--no-ff` merge commit |

