## 3. Sub-Ticket & Accepted-Phase Commit Format (`G3`, `M10`)

| Scenario | Mandatory Commit Subject Format | Example |
|---|---|---|
| **Parent Ticket + Huly Sub-Ticket** | `<type>(<SUB-TICKET>): <summary> [parent: <PARENT-TICKET>, PHASE-NN]` | `feat({{ticket_prefix}}1201): add order creation API [parent: {{ticket_prefix}}1200, PHASE-01]` |
| **Parent Ticket + Multi-Phase (no sub-ticket ID)** | `<type>(<PARENT-TICKET>): [PHASE-NN] <summary>` | `feat({{ticket_prefix}}1200): [PHASE-01] implement order domain and repository` |
| **No Ticket ID (user-supplied requirement)** | `<type>(phase-NN): <summary>` *(only after `PHASE-NN` acceptance)* | `feat(phase-01): implement order creation slice` |

